# ── Source material for the cinematic templates ──
# Saved copies of the licensed source pages, kept locally for reference. Only
# the artwork is ported (into frontend/public/templates/<key>/); the folders
# themselves also carry vendor tracking bundles — a 566KB Google tag bundle and
# a 410KB Facebook pixel — which must never reach the repo or a guest's
# invitation. See test/swanLakeTemplate.test.jsx.
templates/
envelop/

# ── Android ──
# Machine-specific: sdk.dir, and the release signing credentials.
android/local.properties
android/**/build/
android/.gradle/

# Signing keys. A keystore committed even once is compromised permanently —
# git history keeps it after the file is deleted, and this key cannot be
# rotated: Android identifies an app by its signing key, so a replacement key
# produces an app that cannot upgrade an installed one.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
